Variation:
Total expenses were $24.693 million in 2020/21 compared to:
-	$24.007 million in 2019/20;
-	$14.833 million in 2018/19; and
-	$13.566 million in 2017/18. 

Total expenses in 2020/21 and 2019/20 were significantly higher than previous years due to:
-	appointing of contractors to support bushfire recovery efforts;
-	the continuing efforts of the bushfire recovery team;
-	garbage disposal costs due to the bushfire-damaged Corryong landfill being inoperable; and
-	increased levels of depreciation.

